arxiv-2512-23620.description:
A 2025 arXiv research paper by Monica Guica, Université Paris-Saclay, CNRS, CEA, Institut de Physique Théorique, 91191 Gif-sur-Yvette, France, Institute of Physics, Ecole Polytechnique Fedérale de Lausanne, CH-1015 Lausanne, Switzerland. Abstract

This is a combined review on the Kerr/CFT correspondence on the one hand and solvable irrelevant deformations of two-dimensional QFTs - specifically, the
T\bar{T}
and
J\bar{T}
deformations - on the other.
